<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00540">
	<title>Resuming Manual Speed Limit Assist</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03506">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03507">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i25_B10_036_2_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To resume Manual Speed Limit Assist after pausing the function, push the (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_334.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>), (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_335.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>), and (<image href="images/WKIA_079.jpg" scale="15" align="left" placement="inline"/>) switches as follows:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>If you push the (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_334.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch up or (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_335.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch down, the vehicle speed sets to the current speed on the instrument cluster.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>If you push the (<image href="images/WKIA_079.jpg" scale="15" align="left" placement="inline"/>) switch, the vehicle speed resumes the preset speed.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00537.dita#t00537" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
